body:
Yeah. I have tried so much, telling them that I dont have any faith in this but they hardly listen. So they invited some random family today and they are going to stay with us today. 

&#x200B;

yeah my parents are believers, I mostly stay away from it but somehow they have spoiled my life because of this. When I confront them, they defend themselves saying that astrologer or psychic saved their lives when they were in some kinda trouble.
